## Review Checklist

### Architecture
- [ ] Routes → Controllers → Services → Repositories (strict)
- [ ] No direct Prisma calls outside repositories
- [ ] No business logic in routes or repositories
- [ ] Constructor DI in services and controllers

### Node.js Patterns
- [ ] Pino for ALL logging (no console.log)
- [ ] AppError for business errors
- [ ] Async error handling propagated to middleware
- [ ] No hardcoded secrets
- [ ] Module path: `{{ .ModulePath }}`

### Security
- [ ] Input validation (Zod schemas)
{{ if .HasJWT }}- [ ] JWT validation on protected routes
{{ end }}{{ if .HasInternalKey }}- [ ] X-Internal-API-Key validation
{{ end }}- [ ] No sensitive data in logs

### Tests
- [ ] Every source file has `__tests__/` counterpart
- [ ] Jest mocks for external dependencies
- [ ] Both happy path and error paths

